<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 477 0 R
/E (How do we measure its impact in a way that aligns with real business outcomes?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (These are big questions, but each has a clear path forward. While the specifics are different for every organization, there are best practices that smart companies are already putting into place:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 478 0 R
/E (Storing and retrieving knowledge: Move beyond static document repositories and start building structured, queryable knowledge graphs or semantically indexed corpora. This ensures that AI isn't searching through haystacks but instead reasoning through contextual frameworks.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (Structuring information for reasoning: Use canonical formats and metadata standards that reinforce relationships between ideas, not just keywords. This is the groundwork that makes AI reasoning accurate and dependable.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
