224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E (Preserving sovereignty: Architect your AI systems to run on infrastructure you control, with data governance policies that ensure sensitive information never leaves your domain. Design workflows around models that can be swapped or fine-tuned in-house, rather than relying on opaque external APIs. Make no mistake, none of these LLM platforms work for you; they may help you, and you may benefit from their use, but don't get it twisted, they work for their creators first and foremost. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
