<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (To draw a parallel from software engineering, it's not enough to wireframe an app and outsource the code. If you don't invest in the architecture, the version control, and the testing frameworks, you won't get a resilient product. The same is true for AI systems. The sophistication isn't in the user interface; it's in the backend knowledge design and governance.)
/E (To draw a parallel from software engineering, it's not enough to wireframe an app and outsource the code. If you don't invest in the architecture, the version control, and the testing frameworks, you won't get a resilient product. The same is true for AI systems. The sophistication isn't in the user interface; it's in the backend knowledge design and governance.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
